    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>Advanced Approvals refactoring organized approvals into approval categories. Each approval category represents one approval reason, which may require approval from a series of approvers in a hierarchy (i.e., approval steps). 

Approval paths are used to organize approval categories into the first, second, and subsequent approvers in the approval sequence. As such, a single approval category may have one approval step in each approval path.

This object&apos;s purpose is to organize steps by their approval category (or approval reason).</description>
